```

AppRun.lib sets BINDIR/DATADIR/CONFIGDIR/CACHEDIR/STATEDIR defaults using `~` (e.g. `~/.local/share`). `~` won’t reliably expand when produced via parameter expansion/assignment in POSIX sh, so these may become literal paths like `./~/.cache`, breaking multiple hooks that rely on these dirs. Prefer `$HOST_HOME/.local/...` (or `$HOME`) defaults instead of `~`.
```suggestion
	BINDIR=${XDG_BIN_HOME:-$HOST_HOME/.local/bin}
	DATADIR=${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOST_XDG_DATA_HOME}
	CONFIGDIR=${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOST_XDG_CONFIG_HOME}
	CACHEDIR=${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-$HOST_XDG_CACHE_HOME}
	STATEDIR=${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOST_XDG_STATE_HOME}
```
